            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOB.34.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Job 34:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.10.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 10:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O Jehova, ijanza lyako lilisumpwidwe, nekubaboobo tababoni. Babone busungu mbosungwaalila bantu bako, bafwe insoni. Ii, mulilo utente basinkondonyoko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O Jehova, kotubambila luumuno, nkaambo milimo yesu yoonse nduwe waicita mukati kesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.66.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Int 66:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O Jehova Leza wesu, bami bambi batali nduwe batweendelezya, pele nduwe olike ngutuyanda; tulate-mba ula izina lyako olike. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bafwa, tabakooyoopona limbi. Mbasangu, tabakooyoobuka pe. Nkaambo kako wabaswaya, wabanyonyoona, wajaya ciibalusyo cabo coonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wavuzya bantu bacisi, O Jehova, wavuzya bantu bacisi. Nduwe walemekwa. Wakomezya migaano yoonse yanyika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
